=============================================================================
Everything in a single Python file, no build step, no other files needed.

Run it:            python3 wowkernel_one.py
Read the archive:  python3 wowkernel_one.py --archive
Feed + decode:     python3 wowkernel_one.py --decode
Checkpoint to json:python3 wowkernel_one.py --decode --checkpoint out.json

